# Messaging

- Exchange: topic `autopulse.cars`.
- Keys: `car.raw.created`, `car.enriched.success`, `car.enrichment.failed`,
  `car.enrichment.dlq`.
- Declare durable queues with dead-letter routing for enrichment.
- Enrichment: ack only after full aggregation + successful outbound publish.
- Increment `retry_count` on redelivery; move to DLQ when threshold hit.
- Prefer idempotent handlers keyed by `external_id` / `event_id`.
